@api = http://localhost:5080

### 0. DEMONSTRAÇÃO (só em Development): recria as contas *.demo@ com horários a partir de agora
POST {{api}}/api/dev/demo/reset

### Contas da demonstração
GET {{api}}/api/dev/demo

### Entrar sem código por e-mail (copie o accessToken para @token abaixo)
POST {{api}}/api/dev/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana.demo@ufpr.br" }

### Outras: bruno.demo@ufpr.br (motorista), carla.demo@pucpr.edu.br (motorista, tem sugestão de horário),
### eduarda.demo@up.edu.br (em análise), admin.demo@ufpr.br (admin)
POST {{api}}/api/dev/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin.demo@ufpr.br" }

### 1. Pedir código (olhe o console da API para ver o código)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/request-code
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "seunome@ufpr.br" }

### 2. Conferir código
POST {{api}}/api/auth/verify-code
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "seunome@ufpr.br", "code": "000000" }

### 3. Cadastro (cole o signupToken do passo 2)
@signupToken = cole-aqui
POST {{api}}/api/auth/register
Authorization: Bearer {{signupToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ana Ribeiro",
  "birthDate": "2004-03-10",
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "phone": "(41) 99999-0000",
  "course": "Direito",
  "period": 3,
  "shift": "Noite"
}

### 4. Meu perfil (cole o accessToken)
@token = cole-aqui
GET {{api}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4a. Trocar o campus do atalho "Minha faculdade" (ids em GET /api/universities)
PUT {{api}}/api/users/me/campus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "campusId": 2 }

### 4b. Configurações (tema System | Light | Dark)
GET {{api}}/api/users/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{api}}/api/users/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "theme": "Dark", "rideAlerts": true, "alwaysShareTrip": false, "showCourse": true }

### 4c. Casa: 404 home_not_set na primeira vez
GET {{api}}/api/me/places/home
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Definir casa (mande o que veio de GET /api/places/{id})
PUT {{api}}/api/me/places/home
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "R. Bispo Dom José, 2000 - Batel, Curitiba - PR",
  "neighborhood": "Batel",
  "googlePlaceId": "ChIJ...",
  "latitude": -25.4420,
  "longitude": -49.2890
}

###
DELETE {{api}}/api/me/places/home
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4d. Virar motorista: dados da CNH (11 dígitos) e do carro. Status fica None até mandar as duas fotos.
POST {{api}}/api/driver/application
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cnh": "62472927637", "cnhExpiry": "12/2030", "plate": "ABC1D23", "model": "Onix 1.0", "color": "Prata" }

### Foto da CNH (jpg/png/webp, até 5 MB). Troque o caminho por uma foto sua.
POST {{api}}/api/driver/application/cnh-photo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=UniCar

--UniCar
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cnh.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./cnh.jpg
--UniCar--

### Selfie: com as duas fotos, o status vai para InReview
POST {{api}}/api/driver/application/selfie
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=UniCar

--UniCar
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="selfie.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./selfie.jpg
--UniCar--

### Situação do pedido (o que falta, motivo da recusa)
GET {{api}}/api/driver/application
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Carro do motorista aprovado
GET {{api}}/api/driver/vehicle
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4e. Painel de análise (precisa de Role = Admin no banco; o seed de demonstração cria um admin)
@adminToken = cole-aqui
@userId = cole-o-id
GET {{api}}/api/admin/drivers?status=InReview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/admin/drivers/{{userId}}/cnh-photo
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
POST {{api}}/api/admin/drivers/{{userId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
POST {{api}}/api/admin/drivers/{{userId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Foto da CNH ilegível. Mande outra com boa luz." }

### 7. Oferecer: quanto o motorista recebe por passageiro (precisa da chave do Google)
POST {{api}}/api/rides/estimate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": { "address": "R. Bispo Dom José, 2000 - Batel", "neighborhood": "Batel", "latitude": -25.4420, "longitude": -49.2890 },
  "destination": { "address": "Av. Cel. Francisco H. dos Santos, 100 - Jardim das Américas", "neighborhood": "Jardim das Américas", "latitude": -25.4507, "longitude": -49.2316 }
}

### Publicar carona marcada (só motorista aprovado). date/time no horário de Curitiba; 1 a 4 vagas.
POST {{api}}/api/rides
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": { "address": "R. Bispo Dom José, 2000 - Batel", "neighborhood": "Batel", "latitude": -25.4420, "longitude": -49.2890 },
  "destination": { "address": "Av. Cel. Francisco H. dos Santos, 100 - Jardim das Américas", "neighborhood": "Jardim das Américas", "latitude": -25.4507, "longitude": -49.2316 },
  "date": "2026-10-26",
  "time": "07:30",
  "seats": 3
}

### 8. Buscar caronas marcadas para o destino (até 2 km). Com a origem, calcula "passa por você".
GET {{api}}/api/rides/search?destLat=-25.4507&destLng=-49.2316&originLat=-25.4560&originLng=-49.2810&date=2026-10-26
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalhe da carona
@rideId = cole-o-id
GET {{api}}/api/rides/{{rideId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reservar lugar
POST {{api}}/api/rides/{{rideId}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancelar minha reserva (até 30 min antes)
DELETE {{api}}/api/rides/{{rideId}}/reservations/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sugerir 10 min antes (-10) ou depois (10)
POST {{api}}/api/rides/{{rideId}}/time-suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "minutes": 10 }

### Sugestões da carona (motorista vê todas)
GET {{api}}/api/rides/{{rideId}}/time-suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Motorista aceita a sugestão (muda o horário)
@suggestionId = cole-o-id
POST {{api}}/api/rides/{{rideId}}/time-suggestions/{{suggestionId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Passageiros da carona que ofereci
GET {{api}}/api/rides/{{rideId}}/passengers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Motorista cancela a carona (cancela as reservas junto)
DELETE {{api}}/api/rides/{{rideId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Aba Viagens: { upcoming, history }
GET {{api}}/api/me/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recentes (últimos 5 destinos)
GET {{api}}/api/me/places/recent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### "Ninguém indo para lá" → Me avise
POST {{api}}/api/route-alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "label": "UFPR Politécnico", "latitude": -25.4507, "longitude": -49.2316, "radiusKm": 2 }

###
GET {{api}}/api/route-alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. PEDIR AGORA — motorista avisa que está dirigindo (posição + destino). Renove a cada < 2 min.
### Tempo real: conecte no hub {{api}}/hubs/trips?access_token=TOKEN e escute RideRequested, TripUpdated,
### DriverLocation, MessageReceived, Typing, RideUpdated, TimeSuggested, RouteAlertMatched.
@driverToken = cole-aqui
POST {{api}}/api/driver/online
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latitude": -25.4420, "longitude": -49.2890, "destinationLatitude": -25.4507, "destinationLongitude": -49.2316 }

### Passageiro pede ("Procurando colegas"). Motoristas com desvio até 2 km / 5 min recebem RideRequested.
POST {{api}}/api/ride-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": { "address": "Av. República Argentina, 1500 - Água Verde", "neighborhood": "Água Verde", "latitude": -25.4560, "longitude": -49.2810 },
  "destination": { "address": "Av. Cel. Francisco H. dos Santos, 100 - Jardim das Américas", "neighborhood": "Jardim das Américas", "latitude": -25.4507, "longitude": -49.2316 }
}

### Situação do pedido (Searching | Accepted | Cancelled | Expired)
@requestId = cole-o-id
GET {{api}}/api/ride-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancelar enquanto procura
DELETE {{api}}/api/ride-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Motorista: pedidos abertos no meu caminho
GET {{api}}/api/driver/ride-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

### Motorista aceita (o primeiro leva) → vira corrida
POST {{api}}/api/ride-requests/{{requestId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

### Corrida ao vivo (posição, ETA, status, meu pagamento)
@tripId = cole-o-id
GET {{api}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Status (motorista): DriverArrived → InProgress → Completed. Cancelled: qualquer um, antes de embarcar.
POST {{api}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "DriverArrived" }

### Compartilhar trajeto: link público por 4 h
POST {{api}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/share
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### O que o contato de confiança vê (sem login)
@shareToken = cole-aqui
GET {{api}}/api/public/trips/{{shareToken}}

### "Você chegou": Pix ou Card + nota 1–5
POST {{api}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentMethod": "Pix", "rating": 5 }

### Carona marcada: motorista começa (30 min antes até 2 h depois) → corrida com os passageiros
POST {{api}}/api/rides/{{rideId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

### 11. CHAT — conversationId = id da carona marcada (rideId) ou da corrida de pedir agora (tripId)
GET {{api}}/api/conversations/{{rideId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Enviar sem SignalR (pelo hub: SendMessage(conversationId, text); "digitando": Typing(conversationId))
POST {{api}}/api/conversations/{{rideId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Estou chegando!" }

### Respostas rápidas
GET {{api}}/api/conversations/quick-replies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. PERFIL — foto (jpg/png/webp até 5 MB; vira JPEG 512×512). photoUrl é relativo: {{api}}/uploads/...
POST {{api}}/api/users/me/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=UniCar

--UniCar
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="foto.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./foto.jpg
--UniCar--

###
DELETE {{api}}/api/users/me/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Perfil público (nota média, avaliações, viagens; curso só se a pessoa permitir)
@userId2 = cole-o-id
GET {{api}}/api/users/{{userId2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Avaliar alguém da corrida (motorista → passageiro; passageiro → motorista se não avaliou ao pagar)
POST {{api}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toUserId": "{{userId2}}", "stars": 5 }

### 5. Buscar endereço (precisa da chave do Google)
GET {{api}}/api/places/autocomplete?q=hospital%20cajuru&session=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Preço de uma rota (PUCPR -> UFPR Politécnico)
POST {{api}}/api/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "originLat": -25.4517, "originLng": -49.2513, "destinationLat": -25.4507, "destinationLng": -49.2316 }
